          <li id="p3" data-type="heading">
            <p>Quick Fixes</p>
            <ul>
              <li id="JSd" data-done="2026-01-24T17:02:03Z" data-type="task">
                <p>In the event summary, I'd like to be able to long-press on the date or relative date to reveal a popover. This popover would be a more detailed examination of the relative time. It would have the duration in just days as well as a full breakdown of years, months, days, hours, minutes, and seconds.</p>
              </li>
