          <li id="a9IO" data-type="heading">
            <p>Note on expanding the series diagram:</p>
          </li>
          <li id="CE" data-type="note">
            <p>One future feature that's intended to be added relatively soon is to expand on the series diagram so that it can be zoomed in and also scrolled. It will also be desirable to create separate tracks for different topics so that they can be compared on the same timeline. There will be further complexity added to that feature, such as labeling of individual events and drawing in of time spans for topics or events that are shown on the diagram.</p>
